There is full source distribution of LINLIB framework

The distribution is adressed to experienced unix system administrator,
which have to install from scratch all components in order described below.

Order of installation:
1. Format documents, print, read (sorry, most of documents still remain in Russian)
	cd doc/book; make all; more reclam.lp book.lp
	cd doc/man; make all;

2. Compile libraries and utility commands:
	cd src; make all;

3. Compile and test two programs based on LINLIB framework:

3.1 Compile VHSET utility, setup with it keyboard and videoattributes:
	cd prog/vhset; make all; more READ_ME

3.2 Compile ldemo project, make sure it works well:
	cd prog/ldemo; make all; ldemo;

4. Next steps with distribution files.
    Please, redo all desribed in documentation
    to install files in place.
    In case personal installation it is reasonable to
    leave on place directories
	bin, lib, include, prog/proto
    and remove all other with quiet. If place on disk
    is not to shirt it is desirable leave all subdirectories prog.
    Man pages may be installed to standard place:
	cd doc/man; make install;
	whatis linlib; man linlib;

    Please, do not forget to print mini-help files (doc/hlp/*)
    which may be helpfull in everyday usage.

	Directories and files of distribution:
	==============================

  READ_ME   - this text
  doc       - documentation
    doc/book       ads and verbose manual
    doc/man        man pages
    doc/hlp/*      mini-help pages

These directories have to be placed to /usr or /usr/local:
  lib       - runtime librries
  bin       - framework utilities
  include   - header files

  prog      - instant programs
  prog/ldemo    demo sample program
  prog/vhset    video hardware setup on user taste
  prog/proto    prototype of user app

  src       - sources of runtime libraries

  visi      - user interaction preprocessors

  rt11      - RT-11 distribution (РАФОС-2, ФОДОС, ОС ДВК)
  dos       - MS-DOS distribution (which was never completed)
